<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#58534a;">Hi {{name}}, we received a request to reset the password for your {{brand.name}} account.</p>
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#948d80;">This link expires in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes and can be used once. If you did not ask for a reset, no action is needed and your password stays the same.</p>
